@startuml
title View Massage Shop List
autonumber
actor "Registered User" as User
participant "Postman / API Client" as Client
participant "Massage Reservation API" as API
participant "Shop Controller" as Controller
database MongoDB as DB

User -> Client: Request massage shop list
Client -> API: GET /api/v1/shops
API -> Controller: getShops
Controller -> DB: Find and sort shops
alt Query succeeds
    DB --> Controller: Shop information
    Controller --> API: 200 OK with shop list
    API --> Client: Names, addresses, telephone numbers,\nopening and closing times
    Client --> User: Display shops
else Database error
    DB --> Controller: Error
    Controller --> API: 500 Unable to retrieve shops
    API --> Client: Error response
    Client --> User: Show error
end
note over API
    Shop listing is public in the current implementation.
end note
@enduml
